---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use — OnScreenTimer" description="Terms of Use for OnScreenTimer">
	<div class="min-h-dvh flex flex-col">
		<SiteHeader />

		<main class="flex-1 w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-20 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
			<div class="mb-12">
				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 tracking-tight mb-4">
					Terms of Use
				</h1>
			</div>

			<article class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert prose-blue max-w-none space-y-8">
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">1. Using OnScreenTimer</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						OnScreenTimer provides browser-based timer, clock, stopwatch, and productivity utilities for personal and general use.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">2. No account requirement</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						Normal current use of OnScreenTimer does not require an account or registration.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">3. Acceptable use</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						You agree not to intentionally misuse, attack, interfere with, abusively scrape, or attempt to disrupt the service.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">4. Availability</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						The service may change, be updated, become temporarily unavailable, or be discontinued at any time. We do not guarantee uninterrupted uptime or availability.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">5. Accuracy / reliance</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						Timer, Clock, Stopwatch, and task functionality is provided as a convenience. Do not rely on this utility in situations where failure, inaccuracy, or unavailability could create safety-critical, medical, emergency, legal, financial, or similar high-stakes consequences.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">6. Study/productivity content</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						Study Block Presets and our Study &amp; Focus guides are optional organizational ideas. We do not make medical, educational, or productivity guarantees based on your use of these concepts.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">7. Intellectual property</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						The OnScreenTimer site branding, original interface design, content, and original site materials are protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">8. External services</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						OnScreenTimer is primarily a local browser utility. If future features rely on external services, their respective policies and availability apply.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">9. Limitation / disclaimer</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						The service is provided on an "as available" basis. Use of OnScreenTimer is entirely at your own discretion and risk.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">10. Changes</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						These terms may be updated as the service evolves. Continued use indicates your acceptance of the updated terms.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">11. Contact</h2>
					<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						For any inquiries about these Terms, please see our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4">Contact page</a>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</article>
		</main>
		<SiteFooter />
	</div>
</Layout>
